MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_001: Dagsion is so lively. I suppose it's because of the\nHeroic Games.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_002: Hm? Who is that? He seems to be having a lot of\nfun with those kids.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_003: Baw haw haw! Watch this. Here goes! Hup! Wha—\nHow did I miss?!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_004: Hahaha! Wow, old man! You're so bad at this!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_005: Why?! Why can't I hit it?!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_006: Ah, it's him. He's under my protection, as well. He\nseems distressed... I better step in.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_007: What happened, Tobias?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_008: Oh, hey, Toli. I'm having a hard time hitting the\ntarget at this stall. I really wanted a prize.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_009: I see. Aim for the target and throw the ball.\nMay I try?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_010: Sure thing. If you can hit it dead on, that'll get you\nthe best prize. Go on, take a shot.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_011: Alright. I'll aim for the mark, and... Tyah!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_012: Whoa... Nice! Smack in the middle, first try!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_013: That's amazing! This old guy tried like, a dozen times\nand never hit it once!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_014: Bull's-eye! You win the big prize. Here's a token you\ncan exchange for an assortment of fine cheeses.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_015: How many first-prize rewards do you have? I believe\nI get a reward each time I hit the target.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_016: Whoa there, lady. You got lucky once, but I wouldn't\ncount on pulling that off again.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_017: Let's see how many I can get. Haah!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_018: Ohh. Every throw, right on target. I give up.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_019: Alright, one more time...
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_020: No! No more times! You're going to put me out of\nbusiness at this rate.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_021: I see. Very well, then. Thank you.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_022: Here you are, Tobias. These tokens belong to you.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_023: How come? You're the one who earned 'em.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_024: Didn't you want them? I have no need for them.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_025: Oh... You were doing all that for me, huh?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_026: Do you not need them anymore?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_027: Nah, I'll take 'em. Thanks, Toli.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_028: It was nice of you to think of me, but you don't gotta\ngo out of your way.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_029: Hey, fella! Cheer up—I'll cover your losses.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_030: He's comforting the shopkeeper? But why?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_031: This is getting boring. I'm gonna head home.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_C_032: I followed the rules and won the prizes accordingly...\nDid I do something wrong?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_001: Hmm...
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_002: Whatcha doing, Toli? They got you staking out that\nstall or something?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_003: I am currently studying how to properly enjoy\nthe game.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_004: Whaddaya mean, "properly"?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_005: Tobias. I need to apologize to you. I was very rude.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_006: I understand that much at this point. But what I can't\nfigure out is what I did wrong.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_007: I worry that I might mess things up again, and so I'm\nhere trying to figure out how to do better...
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_008: Not sure what you mean, but you don't learn how to\nhave fun by watching. C'mon!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_009: But if I participate, I might ruin everyone's\nfun again...
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_010: Here, this one's pretty simple. All you gotta do is\nstick your hand in the box and pull out a paper.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_011: A lottery drawing? Will this show me the proper way\nto have fun?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_012: Yeah! See, this one doesn't take skill or planning.\nIt's all luck!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_013: If you open it up and see gold, that's first prize. Silver\nis second, and so on. White's a dud. Get it?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_014: I understand. In that case, I'll take this one.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_015: Great! And I'll go wiiith...this one!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_016: Heyyy! I did it! I drew a gold slip!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_017: White. Which means I lose. Let me try again!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_018: Baw haw haw! That's the spirit! I'll play again too.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_019: Third prize might be the best you'll get, Toli.\nGuess I've got all the luck!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_020: While I'm happy to have gotten this coffee-berry\npaste, I'd really have preferred the first-place prize...
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_021: You're just jealous I won three whole lambs of meat.\nWe're gonna feast tonight! Hey, didja have fun?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_022: Yes! I really enjoyed it.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_023: You don't have to try so hard to enjoy stuff the\n"proper" way or whatever.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_024: Just take it easy, and the rest takes care of itself.\nYou'll be having fun in no time!
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_025: Thank you for today. I really appreciate you showing\nme how to have fun with these games.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_026: Could you teach me one last thing, though?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_027: Like you gotta ask! I'll teach you whatever you want,\nToli, over some nice grilled lamb.
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_028: Sounds wonderful! So...how exactly does one "take\nit easy"?
MID_SE_Anh_Tob_B_029: Huh. Maybe I spoke too soon.